Inference Scheduler is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for scheduling
inference work across heterogeneous AI serving infrastructure.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Inference Scheduler does not collect or transmit any telemetry. All telemetry
is written to local files chosen by the operator and never leaves the machine
running the software.

Inference Scheduler accepts contributions from individuals and organizations on
the terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a Contributor License
Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution guidance.
